msgctxt "64"
msgid "There you are..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "You gonna let me see this boss of yours or what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Patience, my friend, patience."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "You know, as long as I've been a hitman, I've held my place at the top."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "My skills come naturally to me, and killing is effortless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"I've killed many people. Getting paid for every kill... Honestly, I "
"couldn't stop smiling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "But then one day, I felt all empty inside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "I'd always been proud of my strength, but I realized it had just been used."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "I got upset at all the rich people and yakuza who had used me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"That's why I joined the Reapers. You might say it's a petty reason, but, "
"hey..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "So you weren't one of those yakuza guys who got kicked out of his family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"That's right. But I chose to join up with our boss because of something he "
"said to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"\"You must seek revenge. If you don't reap their souls yourself, you can "
"never regain what you lost.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "That's why you call yourselves the Reapers, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "After all, a hitman can't support himself unless somebody hires him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"Once I couldn't bear being used anymore, I lost my only means of making a "
"living."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"I had no home, no pride, no friends... It all slipped out of my hands and "
"disappeared."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "I've been fighting as a Reaper to take it all back again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "And when I lost to you, I lost another precious thing:"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "The pride of never losing to anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Is your pride that important?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Yes. I have to get revenge on you to take back that pride."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "That's the real reason you asked me to come here, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Sorry. I guess you won't be meeting the boss after all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "'Cause you're gonna be dead long before you get the chance!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4312"
msgid "Shinzaki"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4316"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""